  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/8d52aeec89489acb86.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"312\" data-original-width=\"299\" height=\"312\" src=\"/assets/images/content/8d52aeec89489acb86.png\" width=\"299\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">התאמה מושלמת</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">חברו בין 2 החלקים של כל ביטוי המוזכר בפרשה:<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">דוגמה: לב - השמים</span></span></p><p></p><ul style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מזרחה - חלב</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הארץ - השמים</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עבר - סגולה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בית - פעור</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עשרת - אבנים</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לוחות - הירדן</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ציפור - הטובה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">צבא - הדברים</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זבת - שמש</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ובשכבך - כנף</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עם - ובקומך</span></li></ul><p></p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">תשבץ מדרג-אות</span></h2><div><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #212121; font-size: large; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: none; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-decoration-line: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 לא מתוחכם<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 נפטרו<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 זהיר ומחושב<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מַרְאֶה - צורה (מהפרשה)<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 סופר<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 רכוש ונכסים<br /></span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 כן</span></p><div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br /></div></span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></h2></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-style: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">התאמה מושלמת</span></span></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מזרחה - שמש,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הארץ</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">- הטובה,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עבר - הירדן,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בית - פעור,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עשרת - הדברים,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לוחות - אבנים,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ציפור - כנף,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">צבא - השמים, זבת - חלב,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ובשכבך -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ובקומך.</span></span></p></span></span></span><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מדרגאות</span></h3><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">תם, </span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">מתו, </span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">מתון, </span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">תמונה, </span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">מונה, </span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">הון, </span><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">הן</span></span></p></span></span></span></div>"
